 (data $11 (i32.const 1055436) "\01\00\00\00c\00\00\00d\00\00\00d\00\00\00TL;DR: Value must not be empty in Storage::set but in most cases you can use Storage::remove instead. Long story: Getting empty values from storage is not well supported at the moment. Some of our internal interfaces cannot differentiate between a non-existent key and an empty value. Right now, you cannot rely on the behaviour of empty values. To protect you from trouble later on, we stop here. Sorry for the inconvenience! We highly welcome you to contribute to CosmWasm, making this more solid one way or the other.\dc\1a\10\00\08\02\00\00/usr/local/cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-6f17d22bba15001f/cosmwasm-std-1.5.11/src/imports.rs\00\00\00\ec\1c\10\00a\00\00\00o\00\00\00\r\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\04\00\00\00e\00\00\00f\00\00\00g\00\00\00h\00\00\00addr_validate errored: \00|\1d\10\00\17\00\00\00input too long for addr_validateaddr_canonicalize errored: \00\bc\1d\10\00\1b\00\00\00input too long for addr_canonicalizeaddr_humanize errored: \00\04\1e\10\00\17\00\00\00MessageTooLong must not happen. This is a bug in the VM.$\1e\10\008\00\00\00\ec\1c\10\00a\00\00\00u\01\00\00\12\00\00\00\ec\1c\10\00a\00\00\00\92\01\00\00\12\00\00\00Error code 2 unused since CosmWasm 0.15. This is a bug in the VM.\00\00\00\84\1e\10\00A\00\00\00\ec\1c\10\00a\00\00\00\ab\01\00\00\12\00\00\00InvalidHashFormat must not happen. This is a bug in the VM.\00\e0\1e\10\00;\00\00\00\ec\1c\10\00a\00\00\00\ac\01\00\00\12\00\00\00\ec\1c\10\00a\00\00\00\cb\01\00\00\12\00\00\00\ec\1c\10\00a\00\00\00\cc\01\00\00\12\00\00\00errorrequestresponseaddrcode_idkindok\00\00\00w\1f\10\00\02\00\00\00T\1f\10\00\05\00\00\00missing field ``\8c\1f\10\00\0f\00\00\00\9b\1f\10\00\01\00\00\00duplicate field `\00\00\00\ac\1f\10\00\11\00\00\00\9b\1f\10\00\01\00\00\00unknown variant ``, there are no variants\00\00\00\d0\1f\10\00\11\00\00\00\e1\1f\10\00\18\00\00\00`, expected \d0\1f\10\00\11\00\00\00\0c \10\00\0c\00\00\00/rustc/eeb90cda1969383f